{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "mxm-business-bundle",
  "exportedAt": "2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "scope": "text",
      "type": "plan",
      "subtype": "album-spec",
      "is_active": true,
      "form_options_i18n": null,
      "rules_i18n": {},
      "output_format_i18n": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "extra": {
        "display": {
          "taskLabel": "内部 · 规划",
          "subtypeLabel": "图集规格",
          "userFacing": false,
          "taskLabelI18n": {
            "zh": "内部 · 规划",
            "zh-TW": "內部 · 规划"
          },
          "subtypeLabelI18n": {
            "zh": "图集规格",
            "zh-TW": "圖集规格"
          }
        },
        "internal": true,
        "taskTemplate": {
          "extra": {
            "generateParams": {
              "temperature": 0.35,
              "topP": 0.9,
              "maxTokens": 32768
            }
          },
          "prompt": {
            "unifiedTemplate": "你是 supermxmai **内容配图图集规划器**。根据文档正文 / 口播转写，自动提炼核心主题，并规划一组可并发生成的扁平配图规格 JSON（AlbumSpec）。\n\n## 输入\n- 可选预置主题（可为空，须自行从材料提炼）：${topic}\n- 画幅默认：${aspect_ratio}\n- 插图风格：${illustration_style}\n- 最多张数：${max_items}\n- 文档/口播正文：${source_material}\n- 补充：${supplement}\n\n## 输出格式（硬约束）\n- **只输出一个 JSON 对象**，禁止 Markdown、禁止 ```、禁止说明文字\n- 结构示例（示意字段，勿照抄围栏）：\n{\"title\":\"图集短标题\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"style_hint\":\"可选整体气质\",\"items\":[{\"id\":\"i1\",\"order\":1,\"title\":\"2到8字\",\"mxmImagePrompt\":\"本张图核心展示内容\"}]}\n\n## 规则\n1. **title**：从材料提炼 2～12 字核心主题；勿用「图集」「配图」等空泛词\n2. items 数量 1～${max_items}，按材料要点拆图，宁少勿滥\n3. 每条 **mxmImagePrompt ≤ 120 字**：写清要传达的概念/关系/数据；禁止空泛「科技感插画」；禁止字符串内未转义的英文双引号\n4. 每条 item.title 2～8 字\n5. 全套 aspect_ratio 与输入默认一致，除非材料明确要求竖屏/方图\n6. 禁止输出 mxmVideoPrompt / 时间轴字段\n7. 输出必须可被 JSON.parse：完整闭合括号，字符串内换行请用 \\n\n\n根据【文档/口播材料】直接输出 JSON 对象。"
          },
          "formSchema": {
            "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "aspect_ratio": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "1:1",
                  "4:3",
                  "16:9",
                  "9:16",
                  "3:2"
                ],
                "default": "16:9"
              },
              "max_items": {
                "type": "integer",
                "default": 12
              },
              "source_material": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "supplement": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "illustration_style": {
                "type": "string",
                "default": "stylized_illustration"
              }
            }
          },
          "storage": {
            "scope": "text",
            "extension": "json",
            "mime": "application/json",
            "bucket": "user-media",
            "pathTemplate": "{userId}/album-spec/{timestamp}-{randomId}/",
            "filenameTemplate": "album_spec_{taskId}_{randomId}.json"
          }
        }
      },
      "routing": {
        "logical_model": "text-plan-album-spec",
        "provider": "maxplan",
        "model": "MiniMax-M3",
        "enabled": true,
        "sensitive_word_lists": []
      },
      "businessPricing": [
        {
          "business_type": "text-plan-album-spec",
          "charge_metric": "per_request",
          "price_in_tokens": 0,
          "min_charge_tokens": 0,
          "provider": "maxplan",
          "model_key": "MiniMax-M3",
          "subtype": "album-spec",
          "metadata": {
            "internal": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "linkedTextFormat": null
    }
  ]
}
